{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1807","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Plus or Minus"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given three integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, and $$$c$$$ such that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of these two equations is true: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a+b=c$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a-b=c$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" Output "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the first equation is true, and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise."}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 162$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The description of each test case consists of three integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a, b \\leq 9$$$, $$$-8 \\leq c \\leq 18$$$). The additional constraint on the input: it will be generated so that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one of the two equations will be true."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output either "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" on a new line, representing the correct equation."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n11\n1 2 3\n3 2 1\n2 9 -7\n3 4 7\n1 1 2\n1 1 0\n3 3 6\n9 9 18\n9 9 0\n1 9 -8\n1 9 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n+\n-\n-\n+\n+\n-\n+\n+\n-\n-\n+\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, $$$1+2=3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, $$$3-2=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, $$$2-9=-7$$$. Note that $$$c$$$ can be negative."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1807A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1807/problem/A"}